<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Octagon Oracle | UFC Fight Predictor</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='css/style.css') }}">
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar">
  <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
    <span class="nav-logo">⬡ OCTAGON ORACLE</span>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/" class="active">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="/predict">Predict</a></li>
    <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <svg class="hero-octagon" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <polygon points="70,5 130,5 195,70 195,130 130,195 70,195 5,130 5,70" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <polygon points="75,15 125,15 185,75 185,125 125,185 75,185 15,125 15,75" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
    AI-Powered Fight Prediction
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero-title">
    WHO WINS<br>
    <span class="line-red">THE OCTAGON?</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">
    Machine learning meets mixed martial arts. Enter fighter statistics
    and let our XGBoost model forecast the outcome with data-driven precision.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="/predict" class="btn btn-primary">⚡ Make a Prediction</a>
    <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">How It Works</a>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-hint">
    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
      <path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
    Scroll
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS STRIP -->
<div style="padding: 0 2rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div class="stats-strip">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">5K+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Historical Fights</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">~72%</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Model Accuracy</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">20+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Features Used</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">3</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Models Tested</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="section">
  <p class="section-label">How It Works</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Data-Driven<br>Fight Intelligence</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">
    Our model analyzes 20+ statistical differentials between fighters
    to forecast who steps out of the octagon victorious.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🥊</div>
      <h3>Striking Analysis</h3>
      <p>Significant strike accuracy, volume, and defensive metrics compared across career averages — not just last-fight stats.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🤼</div>
      <h3>Grappling Metrics</h3>
      <p>Takedown accuracy, submission attempts, and control time differentials that reveal ground game dominance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
      <h3>Win Quality</h3>
      <p>Finish rate breakdown (KO, submission, decision) plus career win ratio and opponent quality weighting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Physical Matchup</h3>
      <p>Height, reach, age, and stance matchup differentials — the physical edges that matter in a real fight.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
      <h3>XGBoost Model</h3>
      <p>Gradient boosted decision trees trained on 5,000+ UFC fights with stratified cross-validation. No data leakage.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
      <h3>Confidence Scoring</h3>
      <p>Every prediction comes with a win probability score — so you know exactly how certain the model is.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">

<!-- CTA BANNER -->
<section style="padding: 5rem 2rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div class="cta-banner">
    <h2>Ready to Predict?</h2>
    <p>Enter fighter statistics and get an instant ML-powered prediction with probability scores and visual breakdowns.</p>
    <a href="/predict" class="btn btn-primary">Start Predicting →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>Octagon Oracle &copy; 2024 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Built with Flask + XGBoost &nbsp;·&nbsp;
     Dataset: <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/rajeevw/ufcdata" target="_blank">UFC Stats (Kaggle)</a>
  </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>